msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dict.remove"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.dict_.accessor.DictAccessor._gen_func.<locals>._inner:1
#: of
msgid "Remove a key from each dict in the column."
msgstr "从列中的每个字典中移除一个键。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dict.remove.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.dict_.accessor.DictAccessor._gen_func.<locals>._inner:3
#: of
msgid "The key to remove, matching the dict's key type."
msgstr "要移除的键，匹配字典的键类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.dict_.accessor.DictAccessor._gen_func.<locals>._inner:5
#: of
msgid ""
"When ``True``, missing keys are silently skipped.  When ``False``, a "
"missing key raises ``KeyError``.  ``None`` dicts are always skipped."
msgstr ""
"当为 ``True`` 时，缺失的键会被静默跳过。当为 ``False`` 时，缺失的键会引发"
" ``KeyError``。``None`` 字典总是被跳过。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dict.remove.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.accessors.dict_.accessor.DictAccessor._gen_func.<locals>._inner:10
#: of
msgid "Single-column LiteFrame with the same map dtype."
msgstr "具有相同映射数据类型的单列 LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dict.remove.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.dict.remove.rst
